==Battleground==
*20 [[CyberFace]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 0.67~1.33 seconds<sup>20f~40f</sup>.
*1 [[The Face]] spawns as the boss.

==Strategy==
This is a gimmick stage, similar to [[Torture Room]]: rush the stage by quickly killing The Face, then destroy the base before the CyberFaces spawn. Although not impossible, beating the CyberFaces is infinitely harder than clearing the stage the intended way.

Alternatively, you can [[Cheese|cheese]] this stage using the [[Crazy Hearts (Combo)|Crazy Hearts Cat Combo]], [[Curling Cat (Rare Cat)|Green Shell Cat]], and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]]. When the stage starts, immediately deploy Green Shell Cat, then repeatedly deploy Courier Cats to destroy the base and win! This strategy works on any Crown Difficulty.

